A||||17||fierogt88||I whooped a camaro!||||1||
Z||000000||fierogt88||06-15-2001||11:12 AM||||I had just left a job interview yesterday, when an '80's camaro pulled up fast on me.  He was reving his engine and riding my rear bumper.  I turned onto NASA Boulevard, and he followed.  I topped the hill and looked out at a half mile of perfectly clear 2 lane road with a really nasty S curve in it...<P>evil grin morphs across my face.<P>The guy is still riding my bumper and reving so I let him have it.  Floored it down the hill and through the S curve.  Going up the hill I looked in the rear view to see Mr. Camaro sh!tt!ng his pants fishtailing through the curve and hitting the curb through the final few feet of it.  By this time I'm way ahead of him and I slowed down, went over the hill and stopped at the light.  He came over, took the right lane and turned.  Never even looked my way, but boy did he look pissed!<P>MuaHaHaHa!!!<P>Disclaimer:  The road and conditions were perfect.  It was essentially a drag strip with an S curve.  The weather was perfect.  We did not cross an overpass and visibility was 100%.  No trees, no telephone poles, no parked cars or semis, no pedestrians, no pets, no airplanes looking for emergency landing strips, no flaming dirigibles, and no purple-people-eaters. The only property that could have been damaged was grass and our own cars.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000001||Cheever2||06-15-2001||11:17 AM||||Now you know where to lure your next victim!<BR>Good show.<BR>||||reg||6
